sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor U as User
  participant AG as Agent
  participant T as Tool catalog
  participant SVC as Services / DB
  participant UI as Generative UI
  U->>AG: Analytical request
  AG->>T: declareMethodology
  T-->>UI: Methodology event
  AG->>T: createPlan
  T-->>UI: Plan HUD event
  AG->>T: queryPartners / scorePartner
  T->>SVC: Validated query
  SVC-->>T: Structured data
  AG->>T: createBarChart / createTable
  T-->>UI: Chart + table cards
  AG->>T: searchDocuments
  T->>SVC: Semantic retrieval
  SVC-->>T: Ranked chunks + citations
  T-->>AG: Cited evidence
  AG->>T: generateReport
  T-->>UI: Report card + PDF
